      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e28de2de059e148d0deb9c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发生了某些她绝不能认可的事情，\r\n以至于连简单看一眼都无法接受。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a91ee66e6fc9c3195e902abaa776f1e17142b215916717e29f0dbcf0c8c39b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c53ffee99983e86c15ae2266",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果可以的话，不想看见这种事情。\r\n如果可以的话，想要假装这种事情从未发生过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f712ca0eed729a3c95b7c7dacd0b94ec5562c61731a0194a26faa20a44812461",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ffaf6dedf79fab3c6801970",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙……其他宇宙的你并没有消失。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0733418374a36f2ea1102c0fb76ad2932a0614425e249044c12ee5e161c5e0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89b042785af57260923b0ef2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽不知她是否是有意地选择回避那种事情……\r\n但不可否认的是，正是这种心态才导致了她的视\r\n野蒙上阴影，让她看不见其他宇宙的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "471ff6cb25a6314d0919a07c4d01036dfcaa4489084a2f320d42bebbd8364159",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676066b286b79a0018963184",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙这个保龄球新手的对手则是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c44ceec7cf57a6d28440a332cb10cf0c68177727108e81fe6fa5fa779e118c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03d8d5aef6ec65e50382a990",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个你应该还存在着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59afe4c36c18c707a92989fb52dc60db981e17d4dede5f3d1b1863a959e69fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
