    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9008e0eda963ab0e306f4d77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "剩下的话，我没有说出口。\r\n而新宇宙，就像是接着我的话说下去一般……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9afd8bab799db110adf630eaf44c557dd0c3a5a1faaa8d6ae38716697aaff286",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
