    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dac62977e11db1ea1f6d415",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要新宇宙……\r\n选择面对真相……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58da65c0e46e16ce218eef587e54b85aeb043f40753b3369107cea0acf4aa5e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:762dd86a22636924fe3741e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我轻轻点头。\r\n现在，我们终于接近了这谜团的中心——",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fdb205a36ecf0baac8e4b3d0750d85afd90ffad3ba6a58c72ba42fea1d98ef7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:877327f8c85134a8e3caac84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们已经找到了问题所在。\r\n如果那属实的话，接下来便需要……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01727447b8c57911ca002cb78d627e6f569d640a3355ab96979846446a5e6a9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d54cc188d6325fbb09c306",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙做好觉悟，\r\n下定决心去观测其他宇宙的“全部”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb089cde2b150da81884b6fe1cf25328495aea1ba935b07535a9ea5168d475f6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b0f3353cc468a910269223",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『天皇赏（春）』后发生了什么——\r\n以及那之后的新宇宙，\r\n“在哪里”“做着什么”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b42797c4688e647792b62656184a9bfc9849783f11dccb304b1d3ea582ac9b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffc3d90254919c4e2114baf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙。不要逃避。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9b8e9e694501cb58640a96f224d66bbc63abac6f68a6c4e5f54ed81830c93e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
