    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c61e322d259cdb1cf8f5aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花桂冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c31c0fde3346564421d9d2eae5169ea9db0122a511fb223e176c94a126e486d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:372320f5c7d718eab2c43625",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要加油哦，小进王，小千代！\r\n既然要说保龄球的话，\r\n那肯定就是咱们仨啦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8c1ef4ca6003f76beb583bc56e4ea923644caccee15a74b1310b5545051f4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5050dda30443c30abcee0ae1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果新宇宙一直选择逃避这真相的话，\r\n我们也无法得知如何解决眼下的困境。",
      "source_fingerprint": "848ec1e69ea2ece7d698531c4411e7d8c43be927601587e7eba397c3b3126fd8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105108.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        80,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/80/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b81cafca397ac0562d94f0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论多么痛苦——也必须要面对事实，\r\n必须要明确地知道那个宇宙究竟发生了什么\r\n才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "268a739e919f32c28c8bfb37548cbeaa70d62608ac1baecabd6dad736d0ba0e8",
